{"id":"6846dcaa8e4f345a","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-k1-con.md","title":"非空域与全常值函数的指标集","display":"df-k1-con — 非空域与全常值函数的指标集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-k1-con","aliases":["20-df-k1-con"],"display":"df-k1-con — 非空域与全常值函数的指标集","chapter":"1","section":"1.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 1.6.15","source_printed_pages":[17],"source_pdf_pages":[53],"depends_on":["[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-df-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-k1-con"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-k1-con</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-k1-con — 非空域与全常值函数的指标集"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 1.6.15"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>53</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\">\\(W_e=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}k1\\text{-}con}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\mathrm K_1:=\\{e:W_e\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\\\ \\mathrm{Con}:=\\{e:\\exists c\\in\\omega\\ \\forall x\\in\\omega\\ [\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=c]\\}.\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}k1\\text{-}con}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\mathrm K_1:=\\{e:W_e\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\\\ \\mathrm{Con}:=\\{e:\\exists c\\in\\omega\\ \\forall x\\in\\omega\\ [\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=c]\\}.\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Con 要求全定义且值恒定，不能把空函数或部分常值函数纳入。K₁ 只要求存在一个停止输入。这补齐原书 Definition 1.6.15 中此前未独立登记的两个指标记号。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 1.6.15；印刷页 17；PDF 第 53 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"W_e=\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}k1\\text{-}con}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\mathrm K_1:=\\{e:W_e\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\\\ \\mathrm{Con}:=\\{e:\\exists c\\in\\omega\\ \\forall x\\in\\omega\\ [\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=c]\\}.\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1189,"backlinks":[{"id":"4033dacb4f25ad78","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-halt]]；see [[20-df-k1-con]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-thm-myhill-isomorphism]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-k1-con]] — 章 1；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-k1-con]]"}],"outgoing":["dc642dd12c05d028","60af447f5d59a8dc"]}